# promtool, Prometheus's own rule checker and unit tester (root ADR-0385), from the Prometheus release
# archive. fetch_pinned.py is the only downloader; the version and SHA-256 live here (root ADR-0197).
# The version is the Prometheus image's in compose.observability.yml, so the rules are tested by the
# engine that evaluates them; the guard prometheus-rules-pass-their-tests refuses the two apart.
# Bump: set the version, then put each archive's line from the release's sha256sums.txt below.
